WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:09.936
Because hanbok fabric wrinkles easily, it's best to change right after arriving at the wedding hall.

2
00:00:10.272 --> 00:00:19.632
If you put it on at the shop and ride in a car, the seatbelt can press the ties and the cramped seat can crease the back of the skirt, spoiling its elegant look.

3
00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:23.136
If you have no choice but to put it on at the shop,

4
00:00:23.472 --> 00:00:31.152
pull the back of the skirt forward, one side at a time, and rest it lightly on your lap when sitting to minimize wrinkling.

5
00:00:31.488 --> 00:00:35.808
Also, fold lines are very visible right after taking the hanbok out of its box,

6
00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:43.008
so ironing it the day before, hanging it up, and keeping it flat during transport is the way to keep it wrinkle-free.
